+ * moved up one level instead — the consumer eases the FRACTION on the boil scheduler's sequence
+ * chain and calls this per frame (HandDrawnGrid, T9-W7 §5), ≤15 re-cuts of four short strings
+ * per fill event, measured at +0ms of median frame time in both engines. The step survives as
+ * the PRM arm and as the fallback should the rung ever read 0.
